Honeysuckle Lane
- Do odd jobs (Uses 2 actions)
	if Global.can_action2():
		if {Inventory.has_item("Saw")}:
			Your saw helps with your work
			set {temp_money} = range(20,81).pick_random()
			set {Global.player_money} += {temp_money}
			You made {temp_money} money
			Your total money is now {Global.player_money}
			do Global.use_action()
			do Global.use_action()
		else:
			set {temp_money} = range(10,51).pick_random()
			set {Global.player_money} += {temp_money}
			You made {temp_money} money
			Your total money is now {Global.player_money}
			do Global.use_action()
			do Global.use_action()
	else:
		You don't have enough actions
- Knock at a random house and ask the resident to let you stay the night.
	label reroll_start
	set {random_chance} = range(1,100).pick_random()
	if {random_chance} <= 20:
		Placeholder person flavor text
		- Stay
		- Leave
		- Reroll (Costs 1 action)
			jump reroll_start
	if {random_chance} >= 21 and {random_chance} <= 40:
		Placeholder person flavor text
		- Stay
		- Leave
		- Reroll (Costs 1 action)
			jump reroll_start
	if {random_chance} >= 41 and {random_chance} <= 60:
		Placeholder person flavor text
		- Stay
		- Leave
		- Reroll (Costs 1 action)
			jump reroll_start
	if {random_chance} >= 61 and {random_chance} <= 80:
		Placeholder person flavor text
		- Stay
		- Leave
		- Reroll (Costs 1 action)
			jump reroll_start
	if {random_chance} >= 81 and {random_chance} <= 100:
		Placeholder person flavor text
		- Stay
		- Leave
		- Reroll (Costs 1 action)
			jump reroll_start
- Break into a house and rob it (Requires crowbar)
	if {Inventory.has_item("Crowbar")}:
		set {random_chance} = range(1,100).pick_random()
		if {random_chance} <= 50:
			set {temp_money} = range(20,81).pick_random()
			set {Global.player_money} += {temp_money}
			You stole {temp_money} money
			Your total money is now {Global.player_money}
			set {temp_resolve_loss} = range(1,10).pick_random()
			set {Global.current_resolve()} -= {temp_resolve_loss}
			You lost {temp_resolve_loss} resolve
			Your total resolve is now {Global.current_resolve()}
			set {crowbar_durability} = Inventory.change_durability("Crowbar", -1)
				if {crowbar_durability} <= 0:
					Your crowbar breaks
				else:
					Your crowbar has {crowbar_durability} durability left
				do Global.use_action()
	else:
		You don't have a crowbar